{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wYrwzpu_EQhOXBuYZ-tWPA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:35.929785+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wYrwzpu_EQhOXBuYZ-tWPA","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/EaUNNzUTv2LdrNb0AmY1KobPPIUM2QzJIhWsia8gCKVVVHIFO51sbZwm03D8WszZhicMWfreX3hnnvLkRiacWGTgaunYmaJObVNupskmmbRgs0/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/IT6hAOfPPEIzEkBerrdfhCPqWcxpC5ZLbuhntn8Gph2YmqUcv2jCm7ibFGibKa6iaMERcfb8QVpPsRmhKbbNicPPP3Qd7WzpVOiafUURKJtA45LI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>深圳大学传播学院具有新闻传播学一级学科博士学位授予权、一级学科硕士学位授予权、新闻与传播专业硕士学位授予权，并设有新闻传播学博士后科研流动站，形成了完整的人才培养体系。目前，在校本科生和研究生1800余人。学院学科综合实力突出，在软科中国最好学科排名中，位居全国前10%，全国第12名；在教育部第五轮学科评估中，新闻传播学科也较第四轮再进一步，取得历史性佳绩。</span></p><p><span><span>学院师资力量雄厚，现有专任教师67人，其中正教授16人，博士生导师18人，硕士生导师50人。师资队伍中汇聚国家“万人计划”领军学者、国家“万人计划”教学名师、教育部青年长江学者、教育部教学指导委员会委员、广东省高层次人才、省级教学名师等一批高层次人才，并聘请多位国际知名学者担任特聘或合作研究教授。</span></span></p><p><span>学院科研平台和学术资源丰富，拥有国家级实验教学示范中心、省级哲学社会科学重点实验室、重点研究基地和高端智库等平台，近年来持续承担国家社科基金重大项目等高层次科研任务。研究生可参与智能传播、数字新闻、网络文明、国际传播等前沿研究，并获得高水平科研项目、国际学术会议、联合培养和海外交流等机会。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span>PART 01</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>申请人必须是具有推荐免试授权高校的应届本科毕业生,并获得所在院校推荐免试资格,占用其本科就读学校的推荐免试指标，推荐手续完备，材料齐全；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></li></ol><ol start=\"2\"><li><p><span>新生报到前必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span>PART 02</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收专业、学制及人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/IT6hAOfPPEJnBqhibGbUse4b51q5BoSWlFUgIpWERMhzKMYBXbPia1m8ibH0RkBopvjYzoSEQUmJbbQibJWW0mLepfkRT2sDyQ1gdTzC0jFzvo8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>*推免预报名系统中的招生学科专业供参考，2027年推免生接收学科以学校公布的2027年研究生招生专业目录为准，最终录取学科专业以全国推免服务系统中录取确认为准。最终接收推免人数以深圳大学研招网公布为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span>PART 03</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.预报名</span></span></strong></p><p><span>有意向申请我院的推免生须在“深圳大学2027年硕士研究生推免生招生预报名系统”进行预报名（便于各招生专业主动联系推免生），网址：http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>传播学院预报名截止时期为2026年</span><strong><span><span>9月17日12：00前</span></span></strong><span>。该系统为学院招生的重要参考，请按要求填写上传相关信息材料。首轮面试将从已进行意向登记的学生中选拔进行。其中：“推免状态”栏，一旦考生推免资格确认，请及时修改相应信息。请考生如实填写有效移动电话和邮箱，并加入传播学院2027推免QQ群（1064865815），后续面试事宜将以电话、邮箱和QQ群作为主要联络和通讯方式。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.系统报名</span></span></strong></p><p><span>“推免服务系统”的开放注册起始时间为9月18日，填报志愿开始时间为</span><strong><span><span>9月21日</span></span></strong><span>，通过我院预推免的同学，需要在招生系统开放前一天确认报名意愿，在9月21日系统开放当天登陆中国研究生招生信息网的“推免服务系统”（网址:https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）完成系统报名。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span>PART 04</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学生参加复试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>经审核通过的复试申请人，学院将以邮件、电话或QQ群消息的形式通知其复试的具体安排。复试时间预计为9月中旬，具体复试形式及时间安排以学院通知为准。</span></p><p><span>请已报名的同学务必进群，后续复试事宜也将在QQ群中告知。进群的同学需将群内昵称改为真实姓名+报考学位类型。例：张三+专硕/学硕。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><se